# Source artwork for the packed tileset.
#
# The pack in assets/packs/ is what ships; the loose PNGs must never be
# committed. Kept as a guard rather than a convention: one `git add -A` in the
# wrong folder is all it would take.
assets/_source/
tileset-source/
*.rar
docs/art/tileset/CATALOGO.png
docs/art/tileset/OBJETOS.png
